# Keep the Docker build context lean: binaries and history the image
# never needs. (The image gets its images from assets/hero + assets/stock.)
.git/
# Regenerable dev artifacts (tools/audit_heroes.py, tools/fetch_hero_cands.py).
# Not in the repo normally, but ignored defensively so re-running those tools
# can never bloat the build context.
hero_audit/
assets/hero_candidates/
data/*.xlsx
